/* generated from andI : {F,G}ded F⟶ded G⟶ded (and F G) */

ded X3 (and F G) :- help/andI X3 F G X1 X2 , ded X1 F , ded X2 G.

help/andI (prodcert X4/1 X4/2) F G (prodcert X2/1 X2/2) (prodcert X3/1 X3/2) :- help/andI X4/1 F G X2/1 X3/1 , help/andI X4/2 F G X2/2 X3/2.

help/andI (idcert X3) F G (idcert X2) (idcert X2) :- X3 > 0 , X2 is X3 - 1.

help/andI (ptcert (andI F G X2 X3)) F G (ptcert X2) (ptcert X3).

help/andI (ucert X2) F G (ucert (prep (ded X3 F) X2)) (ucert (prep (ded X3 F) X2)) :- ded X3 F , occatmost (ded X3 F) 1 X2.

help/andI (hdcert X2) F G (hdcert X2) (hdcert X2).

